Instruction : STDFQ
Details :
The store double floating-point deferred-trap queue instruction (STDFQ) copies
an entry from the floating-point deferred-trap queue into memory. This
implementation has no floating-point deferred-trap queue at all
(implementation_has_no_floating_point_queue is hardwired 1), so STDFQ must
always trap fp_exception with FSR.ftt=sequence_error and must not perform
the store, regardless of FSR.qne.
